i class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#4_Applications_in_Food_Industry" >4. 食品工業的應用</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#41_Potato_Flakes" >4.1 洋芋片</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#42_Potato_Granules" >4.2 馬鈴薯顆粒</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#5_Advantages_Performance_Attributes" >5. 優點 &amp; 性能屬性</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#51_Potato_Flakes" >5.1 洋芋片</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#52_Potato_Granules" >5.2 馬鈴薯顆粒</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#6_Selection_Guidelines_for_Manufacturers" >6. 製造商選擇指南</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#7_Conclusion" >7. 結論</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-15" href="#Frequently_Asked_Questions" >常見問題解答</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-16" href="#What_is_the_difference_between_potato_flakes_and_granules" >馬鈴薯片和顆粒有什麼區別?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-17" href="#Which_product_is_better_for_mashed_potato_dishes" >哪種產品更適合土豆泥菜餚?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-18" href="#Can_potato_flakes_be_used_directly_for_consumption" >洋芋片可以直接吃嗎?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-19" href="#How_are_potato_flakes_and_granules_processed_differently" >馬鈴薯片和顆粒的加工有何不同?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-20" href="#What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_flakes" >馬鈴薯全片的主要用途有哪些?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-21" href="#What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_granules" >馬鈴薯顆粒的主要用途有哪些?</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-22" href="#References" >參考</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="221" data-end="239"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_Overview"></span><strong data-start="224" data-end="239">1. 概述</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="241" data-end="600">馬鈴薯片和馬鈴薯顆粒是馬鈴薯原料經過深層加工生產的兩種重要的脫水馬鈴薯原料. 儘管它們在原材料和基本加工步驟上有相似之處, 他們的不同之處在於 <strong data-start="465" data-end="531">實體形態, 功能特性, 和最佳應用</strong> 在工業食品生產中. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 馬鈴薯片製造商</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="602" data-end="605" /><h2 data-start="607" data-end="652"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_Production_Processing_Differences"></span><strong data-start="610" data-end="652">2. 生產 &amp; 加工差異</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="654" data-end="859">儘管兩種產品的起始原料和主要加工階段相似 (洗滌, 脫皮, 烹飪, 糖化), 這 <strong data-start="789" data-end="858">關鍵差異發生在乾燥和漿料形成步驟</strong>:</p><h3 data-start="861" data-end="882"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Potato_Flakes"></span><strong data-start="865" data-end="882">洋芋片</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="884" data-end="1376"><li data-start="884" data-end="944"><p data-start="886" data-end="944">製作者： <strong data-start="898" data-end="913">滾筒乾燥</strong> (也稱為滾筒乾燥).</p></li><li data-start="945" data-end="1079"><p data-start="947" data-end="1079">將煮熟的馬鈴薯泥漿鋪在加熱的滾筒上, 形成快速乾燥的薄片，然後破碎成薄片.</p></li><li data-start="1080" data-end="1157"><p data-start="1082" data-end="1157">得到的產品是 <strong data-start="1107" data-end="1154">片狀, 不規律的, 且尺寸更大</strong>.</p></li><li data-start="1158" data-end="1283"><p data-start="1160" data-end="1283">滾筒乾燥使澱粉部分糊化，但未完全煮熟, 留下一些結構以便進一步處理.</p></li><li data-start="1284" data-end="1376"><p data-start="1286" data-end="1376">非常適合用作其他配方的原料. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 馬鈴薯片製造商</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><p><a href="/zh-tw/products/">去查看我們的產品</a></p><h3 data-start="1378" data-end="1401"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Potato_Granules"></span><strong data-start="1382" data-end="1401">馬鈴薯顆粒</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="1403" data-end="1867"><li data-start="1403" data-end="1512"><p data-start="1405" data-end="1512">生產使用 <strong data-start="1420" data-end="1461">噴霧或附聚乾燥方法</strong> 創造統一的 <strong data-start="1482" data-end="1509">細粒狀顆粒</strong>.</p></li><li data-start="1513" data-end="1582"><p data-start="1515" data-end="1582">這導致 <strong data-start="1533" data-end="1579">更充分的煮熟和顆粒結構</strong>.</p></li><li data-start="1583" data-end="1688"><p data-start="1585" data-end="1688">顆粒往往是 <strong data-start="1605" data-end="1646">較小, 更統一, 更高的密度</strong>, 並重新水化成更光滑的質地.</p></li><li data-start="1689" data-end="1867"><p data-start="1691" data-end="1867">由於顆粒形成過程中的蒸煮更完全, 顆粒可以達到 <strong data-start="1773" data-end="1809">補水後質地更細膩</strong> 與片狀相比. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 馬鈴薯片製造商</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="1869" data-end="2008"><p data-start="1871" data-end="2008"><strong data-start="1871" data-end="1907">您的行業經驗一致:</strong> 由於滾筒乾燥，薄片呈片狀, 而顆粒較細，顆粒結構清晰.</p></blockquote><hr data-start="2010" data-end="2013" /><h2 data-start="2015" data-end="2060"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Functional_Properties_Differences"></span><strong data-start="2018" data-end="2060">3. 功能特性 &amp; 差異</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" data-start="2062" data-end="2858"><thead data-start="2062" data-end="2107"><tr data-start="2062" data-end="2107"><th data-start="2062" data-end="2072" data-col-size="md">特徵</th><th data-start="2072" data-end="2088" data-col-size="md">洋芋片</th><th data-start="2088" data-end="2107" data-col-size="sm">馬鈴薯顆粒</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2155" data-end="2858"><tr data-start="2155" data-end="2196"><td data-start="2155" data-end="2162" data-col-size="md">形式</td><td data-start="2162" data-end="2180" data-col-size="md">不規則片狀</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2180" data-end="2196">細顆粒</td></tr><tr data-start="2197" data-end="2326"><td data-start="2197" data-end="2234" data-col-size="md">產品配方中的典型用途</td><td data-start="2234" data-end="2286" data-col-size="md">零食的多功能成分, 混合產品</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2286" data-end="2326">主要用於馬鈴薯泥產品</td></tr><tr data-start="2327" data-end="2387"><td data-start="2327" data-end="2343" data-col-size="md">乾燥方法</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2343" data-end="2357">滾筒乾燥</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2357" data-end="2387">噴霧/附聚乾燥</td></tr><tr data-start="2388" data-end="2440"><td data-start="2388" data-end="2413" data-col-size="md">烹飪/糊化</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2413" data-end="2423">部分的</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2423" data-end="2440">更完整</td></tr><tr data-start="2441" data-end="2506"><td data-start="2441" data-end="2463" data-col-size="md">補水質</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2463" data-end="2484">較粗, 某個身體</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2484" data-end="2506">奶油味兒, 更順暢</td></tr><tr data-start="2507" data-end="2572"><td data-start="2507" data-end="2526" data-col-size="md">吸水率</td><td data-start="2526" data-end="2537" data-col-size="md">緩和</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2537" data-end="2572">降低並有效吸收</td></tr><tr data-start="2573" data-end="2628"><td data-start="2573" data-end="2598" data-col-size="md">黏度 (再水化的)</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2598" data-end="2607">更高</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2607" data-end="2628">較低至中等</td></tr><tr data-start="2629" data-end="2742"><td data-start="2629" data-end="2660" data-col-size="md">在二次加工中的作用</td><td data-start="2660" data-end="2701" data-col-size="md">作為黏合劑效果很好, 紋理修改器</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2701" data-end="2742">非常適合直接搗碎的產品</td></tr><tr data-start="2743" data-end="2858"><td data-start="2743" data-end="2858" data-col-size="md"><em data-start="2743" data-end="2858">(基於加工和結構的一般行業功能差異) <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://potatogoodness.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Module-4-final.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">馬鈴薯的好處</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></em></td><td data-col-size="md"></td><td data-col-size="sm"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h3 data-start="2860" data-end="2896"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="31_Cooking_Gelatinization"></span><strong data-start="2864" data-end="2896">3.1 烹飪 &amp; 糊化</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2898" data-end="3381">一個重要的細微差別——<strong data-start="2918" data-end="2971">馬鈴薯片一般沒有完全糊化</strong> 乾燥期間, 因為它們預計將用於進一步加工，其中加熱/澱粉糊化將在稍後完成. 這使得薄片適合作為 <strong data-start="3132" data-end="3158">配方成分</strong> 而不是成品食品. 反過來, <strong data-start="3208" data-end="3293">馬鈴薯顆粒通常在乾燥/結塊階段完全糊化</strong>, 給他們一個 <strong data-start="3309" data-end="3356">直接補水時口感較滑</strong>. (您的專家見解)</p><p data-start="3383" data-end="3438">這種差異影響 <strong data-start="3407" data-end="3435">補水後的質地</strong>:</p><ul data-start="3439" data-end="3662"><li data-start="3439" data-end="3557"><p data-start="3441" data-end="3557"><em data-start="3441" data-end="3450">薄片:</em> 當摻入複合配方時，往往會生產出具有更多結構或口感的產品.</p></li><li data-start="3558" data-end="3662"><p data-start="3560" data-end="3662"><em data-start="3560" data-end="3571">顆粒劑:</em> 生產更順暢, 單獨加水時，糖化效果更細膩. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://potatogoodness.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Module-4-final.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">馬鈴薯的好處</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><hr data-start="3664" data-end="3667" /><h2 data-start="3669" data-end="3708"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_Applications_in_Food_Industry"></span><strong data-start="3672" data-end="3708">4. 食品工業的應用</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="3710" data-end="3878">馬鈴薯片和顆粒均可用於各種加工食品類別, 但他們的 <strong data-start="3798" data-end="3831">首選應用不同</strong> 基於質地和配方要求.</p><h3 data-start="3880" data-end="3905"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="41_Potato_Flakes"></span><strong data-start="3884" data-end="3905">4.1 洋芋片</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="3907" data-end="3940">馬鈴薯片廣泛應用於:</p><ul data-start="3942" data-end="4308"><li data-start="3942" data-end="3999"><p data-start="3944" data-end="3999">零食和方便食品 (籌碼, 膨化零食)</p></li><li data-start="4000" data-end="4045"><p data-start="4002" data-end="4045">烘焙產品 (卷, 麵包, 餅乾)</p></li><li data-start="4046" data-end="4089"><p data-start="4048" data-end="4089">複合食品 (混合, 混合)</p></li><li data-start="4090" data-end="4144"><p data-start="4092" data-end="4144">水結合成分, 紋理修改</p></li><li data-start="4145" data-end="4195"><p data-start="4147" data-end="4195">風味增強和營養強化</p></li><li data-start="4196" data-end="4308"><p data-start="4198" data-end="4308">需要堅固耐用的工業混合配方, 溶解性較小的顆粒 <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/why-use-potato-flakes-what-are-the-applications/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 馬鈴薯片製造商</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><h3 data-start="4310" data-end="4337"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="42_Potato_Granules"></span><strong data-start="4314" data-end="4337">4.2 馬鈴薯顆粒</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4339" data-end="4376">通常選擇馬鈴薯顆粒:</p><ul data-start="4378" data-end="4673"><li data-start="4378" data-end="4430"><p data-start="4380" data-end="4430"><strong data-start="4380" data-end="4414">即食馬鈴薯泥產品</strong> (主要用途)</p></li><li data-start="4431" data-end="4494"><p data-start="4433" data-end="4494">準備好的飯菜, 機構餐飲服務 (學校, 醫院)</p></li><li data-start="4495" data-end="4520"><p data-start="4497" data-end="4520">湯底, 乾混料</p></li><li data-start="4521" data-end="4576"><p data-start="4523" data-end="4576">醬汁中的增稠劑和質地改良劑, 肉汁</p></li><li data-start="4577" data-end="4673"><p data-start="4579" data-end="4673">具有光滑質地要求的零食和烘焙混合物 <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://sahugroup.co.in/potato-granules/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">sahugroup.co.in</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><hr data-start="4675" data-end="4678" /><h2 data-start="4680" data-end="4725"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_Advantages_Performance_Attributes"></span><strong data-start="4683" data-end="4725">5. 優點 &amp; 性能屬性</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="4727" data-end="4752"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="51_Potato_Flakes"></span><strong data-start="4731" data-end="4752">5.1 洋芋片</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4753" data-end="5074"><li data-start="4753" data-end="4827"><p data-start="4755" data-end="4827"><strong data-start="4755" data-end="4771">多功能性:</strong> 非常適合土豆泥以外的各種應用.</p></li><li data-start="4828" data-end="4942"><p data-start="4830" data-end="4942"><strong data-start="4830" data-end="4859">成分功能:</strong> 可以改善水結合力, 質地, 並可包含在複合食品混合物中.</p></li><li data-start="4943" data-end="5074"><p data-start="4945" data-end="5074"><strong data-start="4945" data-end="4965">成本效益:</strong> 由於乾燥過程經濟性，與顆粒相比成本通常較低. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 馬鈴薯片製造商</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><h3 data-start="5076" data-end="5103"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="52_Potato_Granules"></span><strong data-start="5080" data-end="5103">5.2 馬鈴薯顆粒</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="5104" data-end="5386"><li data-start="5104" data-end="5187"><p data-start="5106" data-end="5187"><strong data-start="5106" data-end="5125">奶油質地:</strong> 顆粒再水化成更光滑、更均勻的糊狀.</p></li><li data-start="5188" data-end="5257"><p data-start="5190" data-end="5257"><strong data-start="5190" data-end="5209">更高密度:</strong> 更好的倉儲和運輸效率.</p></li><li data-start="5258" data-end="5386"><p data-start="5260" data-end="5386"><strong data-start="5260" data-end="5288">成品使用能力:</strong> 適合直接補水作為糖化成品. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.idahopacific.com/potato-granules?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">愛達荷太平洋公司</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><hr data-start="5388" data-end="5391" /><h2 data-start="5393" data-end="5441"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Selection_Guidelines_for_Manufacturers"></span><strong data-start="5396" data-end="5441">6. 製造商選擇指南</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5443" data-end="5515">在食品生產中選擇薄片和顆粒時, 考慮:</p><div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" data-start="5517" data-end="5904"><thead data-start="5517" data-end="5547"><tr data-start="5517" data-end="5547"><th data-start="5517" data-end="5526" data-col-size="sm">因素</th><th data-start="5526" data-end="5535" data-col-size="sm">薄片</th><th data-start="5535" data-end="5547" data-col-size="sm">顆粒劑</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="5579" data-end="5904"><tr data-start="5579" data-end="5640"><td data-start="5579" data-end="5603" data-col-size="sm">最終產品質地</td><td data-start="5603" data-end="5622" data-col-size="sm">結構化, 身體</td><td data-start="5622" data-end="5640" data-col-size="sm">光滑的, 奶油味的</td></tr><tr data-start="5641" data-end="5719"><td data-start="5641" data-end="5651" data-col-size="sm">最終用途</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="5651" data-end="5682">零食中的成分 / 混合</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="5682" data-end="5719">直接搗碎 / 順利申請</td></tr><tr data-start="5720" data-end="5799"><td data-start="5720" data-end="5745" data-col-size="sm">加工要求</td><td data-start="5745" data-end="5774" data-col-size="sm">預計二次烹飪</td><td data-start="5774" data-end="5799" data-col-size="sm">補水後準備好</td></tr><tr data-start="5800" data-end="5845"><td data-start="5800" data-end="5826" data-col-size="sm">配方彈性</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="5826" data-end="5833">高的</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="5833" data-end="5845">緩和</td></tr><tr data-start="5846" data-end="5904"><td data-start="5846" data-end="5867" data-col-size="sm">成本考慮</td><td data-start="5867" data-end="5885" data-col-size="sm">一般較低</td><td data-start="5885" data-end="5904" data-col-size="sm">可能會更高</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p><a href="/zh-tw/about-us/">關於我公司資質</a></p><hr data-start="5906" data-end="5909" /><h2 data-start="5911" data-end="5931"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="7_Conclusion"></span><strong data-start="5914" data-end="5931">7. 結論</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5933" data-end="6483">馬鈴薯片和馬鈴薯顆粒源自相同的原料和相似的早期加工過程, 他們的分歧在於 <strong data-start="6062" data-end="6136">乾燥法, 顆粒形式, 烹飪程度, 和應用重點</strong>. 馬鈴薯片是一種多功能工業原料，非常適合零食和混合產品, 而顆粒提供了 <strong data-start="6259" data-end="6306">更細膩的質地和直接搗碎的能力</strong> 適用於馬鈴薯泥產品. 了解這些差異使製造商能夠優化兩者的配方 <strong data-start="6432" data-end="6482">功能性能和最終產品品質</strong>.</p><hr data-start="6485" data-end="6488" /><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Frequently_Asked_Questions"></span><strong>常見問題解答</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_is_the_difference_between_potato_flakes_and_granules"></span>馬鈴薯片和顆粒有什麼區別?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>馬鈴薯片呈片狀且部分糊化, 理想的零食和複合產品成分. 顆粒完全糊化, 較小, 更順暢, 適用於即食馬鈴薯泥產品.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Which_product_is_better_for_mashed_potato_dishes"></span>哪種產品更適合土豆泥菜餚?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>馬鈴薯顆粒是馬鈴薯泥菜餚的首選，因為它們已完全煮熟，並且在再水化時產生更奶油般的質地.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Can_potato_flakes_be_used_directly_for_consumption"></span>洋芋片可以直接吃嗎?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>馬鈴薯片通常未完全煮熟，旨在用作進一步加工的原料, 而不是直接消費.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_are_potato_flakes_and_granules_processed_differently"></span>馬鈴薯片和顆粒的加工有何不同?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>兩種產品有相似的加工步驟, 但將薄片滾筒乾燥以產生片狀薄片, 而顆粒被乾燥/附聚以產生小顆粒, 均勻顆粒.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_flakes"></span>馬鈴薯全片的主要用途有哪些?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>馬鈴薯片用於零食, 烘焙產品, 複合混合物, 以及作為水結合和質地改性的功能成分.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_granules"></span>馬鈴薯顆粒的主要用途有哪些?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>馬鈴薯顆粒用於即食馬鈴薯泥, 湯, 準備好的飯菜, 以及其他需要光滑的產品, 奶油質地.</p></div><hr /><h2 data-start="6490" data-end="6520"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="References"></span><strong data-start="6493" data-end="6520">參考 </strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul><li data-start="6490" data-end="6520">馬鈴薯片與顆粒: 差異解釋. (日期不詳。). <em data-start="6582" data-end="6615">馬鈴薯片製造商 XION</em>. 取自 <a class="decorated-link" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_new" rel="noopener nofollow" data-start="6632" data-end="6735">https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-capsules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/</a> <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://ww